[Graphics:Notes]
<p>The colours of Sabreman, the rocks, the stalactites, the spikes, the
weapons, the fire, the decorations and the extra life are set by the
game code or data. For all of the other sprites the colour has not been
established yet, and they are shown in bright white.</p>
